TITLE Calcite kinetic reaction with acidic Cu-Ba solution at 200 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5
KINETICS 1
Calcite
    -m0 1
    -m 1
    -parms 1.0 10
    -tol 1e-12
    -steps 1000 in 100
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -step true
    -totals C(4) Cu(2)
END
